      "source": "Combobox.svelte in kandan-ui-svelte, built to these rules",
      "certain": true,
      "note": "Escape is prevented only while the listbox is open, so an enclosing dialog stays open; with the listbox closed it is left alone."
    },
    {
      "name": "closes the listbox on a press outside",
      "fixture": "combobox/default",
      "given": [
        {
          "selector": ".combobox .input",
