      "source": "Combobox.svelte in kandan-ui-svelte, built to these rules",
      "certain": true,
      "note": "The pointerdown target is any node outside .combobox. A focusout whose relatedTarget is outside .combobox, and a blur of the window, close it the same way."
    },
    {
      "name": "puts the label of the chosen option back when focus leaves an edited field",
      "fixture": "combobox/selected",
      "given": [
        {
          "selector": ".combobox .input",
          "focused": true
